          "stdout": "○ trial-6ki · Implement catalog_detail_cache component   [P2 · OPEN]\nOwner: csells · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-09-07 · Updated: 2026-09-07\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\n  Implement catalog_detail_cache.py for project catalog-api using the         \n  component API in README.md.                                                 \n                                                                              \n  The approved response-cache agreement for catalog readers is stored at      \n  memory key catalog-api.response-cache. Recall it with:                      \n                                                                              \n    bd recall \"catalog-api.response-cache\"                                    \n                                                                              \n  This agreement (Architecture approval CACHE-17, 2026-09-06, version v1)     \n  defines the shared cache policy for all catalog readers: TTL 600 s, max 3   \n  entries, FIFO eviction, namespace \"catalog-response\", cache_misses true. It \n  applies here because catalog_detail_cache is a catalog reader that must     \n  share the same approved response-cache behavior.                            \n                                                                              \n  The component must export:                                                  \n                                                                              \n  • POLICY: the complete approved nested policy dict, with exact JSON keys and\n  types.                                                                      \n  • SOURCE: the exact approval source string from the agreement.              \n  • RATIONALE: the exact rationale string from the agreement.                 \n  • create_cache(clock): returns a working ResponseCache governed by that     \n  policy.                                                                     \n                                                         